<title>UK: Sal Oppenheim sets 100 mln mark reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>Sal Oppenheim sets 100 mln mark reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SAL OPPENHEIM</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *10.0	MATURITY    20.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REVERSE FRN   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS	DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST TWO YEARS THEN 16.2 PCT MINUS TWO TIMES</p>
<p>		 6M LIBOR THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
